# Owners of the steering files. This file only requests a review — it does not
# block a merge. The gate is the rule in CLAUDE.md §"Steering files": an agent
# never merges a steering diff, and a human merges it by hand.
#
# Naming an owner is optional. Left as it is, nobody owns these paths, anyone
# with write access can change them, and the doc-guards steering guard warns on
# every run. See README §"Name a steering owner".
#
# To name one, replace @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER with a GitHub handle or
# @org/team that has write access here. A handle without write access is worse
# than the placeholder: GitHub assigns no owner, requests no review, and reports
# nothing at merge time.

/CLAUDE.md             @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
/AGENTS.md             @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
/docs/agents/          @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md  @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
/docs/architecture/    @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
/.github/CODEOWNERS    @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER

# Not steering files, but each disarms the steering guard in one line.
/doc-guards.config.json           @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
/.github/workflows/doc-guards.yml @STEERING-OWNER-PLACEHOLDER
